---
# Tests inherit the project config, with three checks switched off:
#   - readability-magic-numbers: expected values are worked out by hand and are clearer inline.
#   - bugprone-unchecked-optional-access: the checker does not understand that
#     ASSERT_TRUE(opt.has_value()) returns from the test, so every later opt-> is flagged.
#   - readability-function-cognitive-complexity: GoogleTest macros expand into hidden
#     if/else/switch blocks, which inflates the score of short, simple tests.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity
